{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵盖鲁尔特","text":"[show]我听说刚刚你们把地窖里的魔物都清理了一番，还打败了蜘蛛女王，解决了困扰着驿站的大麻烦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵盖鲁尔特","text":"[show]没想到前不久才成为契约者的你们，居然能在这么短的时间内进步到这种程度，真的非常厉害。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]哼哼～这对我们来说没什么难的啦！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵盖鲁尔特","text":"[show]谦虚了哈哈，多亏有你们，我们也有机会重开挑战赛了。说起来，要不要来报名参加第一届“挑战赛”呢？[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"“挑战赛”是什么？","tag":"tag_7"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵盖鲁尔特","text":"[cm][show]这是我们驿站传统的活动，具体内容就是举办能让每个契约者小队之间相互切磋的比赛。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]契约者之间……相互切磋的比赛？也就是说我们要和别的契约者对决吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵盖鲁尔特","text":"[show]没错，两方契约者自行组成队伍，在赛场上进行公平的对决，获胜者可以获得丰厚的奖励。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵盖鲁尔特","text":"[show]当年我所在的队伍就曾是排名领先的战队之一，不过我现在已经退居幕后当上评审了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]听起来很不错啊，获胜之后还能拿到奖励，有点心动了呢。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵盖鲁尔特","text":"[show]最近因为魔物作乱的问题，挑战赛一直难以展开。不过现在很多人看见你们势头正盛，都想向你们发起挑战呢。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2l","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2l","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]哈？居然敢向我们发起挑战，我们会把他们打得落花流水！对吧{myName}？[l]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2l","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"把他们全部打败！","tag":"tag_15"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卫兵盖鲁尔特","text":"[show][cm]这个气势不错嘛。不然趁这个势头，我教你们如何组织队员吧。我听说你们有伙伴会聚在你们的营地，不然就在那里聊好了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]哦哦，要回营地去啊。那也行，我们出发！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":340,"trans":true,"y":-180,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"script":"m_1_7_13","des":"【盖鲁尔特先生，有什么事吗？】"}